      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{60285ca04963ba22994f485b|full_name}: What I am talking about in this thread is the eye tracking built into VRChat, which sends OSC via VRCFaceTracking.\n\nVRChat's built-in eye tracking says that smoothing is automatic, but I honestly don't see the effect of it; the blue sphere shown in Debug is vibrating fine, and the eyeballs are vibrating in time with it.\n\nIt would be useful to be able to freely adjust the intensity and on/off of the smoothing.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
